      "message": "Merge upstream main into issue/1095-lateral-rapid-stock-top; lateral rapids take #1098's excess rules\n\n#1098 landed (0fc30b65) with its final stock-top rules. The one\nconflicting line, the dive's clear_of call, keeps both sides: this\nbranch's (c, c) point trace and main's tip lowered by the model excess.\n\nPer the review of 7e8d92cf, the lateral branch takes the same rules:\nthe tip at low - e (bands(tool, e) and the non-finite-excess refusal\ncame in with the merge). New pin:\na_traverse_takes_the_coarse_models_excess_like_a_dive. It fails with\nthe lateral tip left at low.\n\nstepped_stock_link.rs keeps the casting as raw stock only instead of\ndeleting it. Since #1056, a from-model stock whose source is gone is\nnever re-read.\n\nRefs #1095\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
